         -* ICY TERM #VERSION *-

A modern terminal program for BBS systems.

- Written in pure rust
- Multi platform Windows, OSX, Linux
- Telnet, SSH, RLogin, TCP & WebSocket
- Modems & SOCKS5 proxies (Tor/I2P)
- ANSI, PETSCII, ATASCII, VIEWDATA,
  Atari ST VT52/IGS, RIPscrip & SkyPix
- X/Y/Z Modem transfers, including ZModem 8k
- Dialing directory & IEMSI login
- Scrollback, search, capture & replay
- SyncTERM doors: cached JXL, Audio
  APC/Opus, Kitty keys & pixel mouse
- Lua scripting & MCP automation
- 3D accelerated with CRT effects
- Copy & Paste

For latest builds/development visit:
GitHub https://github.com/mkrueger/icy_tools
